{"ID":"20251104172753-5vtxovd","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20251104172753-5vtxovd","title":"UPL9-4——遮挡剔除","type":"doc","updated":"20251106140854"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104172753-e38mo8z","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20251104172753-e38mo8z","updated":"20251105111935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"遮挡剔除"}]},{"ID":"20251104173025-8ykyp0o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104173025-8ykyp0o","updated":"20251104173231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unity 默认只会进行视锥剔除，即摄像机视锥外的物体不会渲染，\n但是在视锥内，被其他物体挡住的东西仍然会被渲染，而遮挡剔除就是用来弥补这一点的"}]},{"ID":"20251104173159-9q34dqg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104173159-9q34dqg","updated":"20251104173303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"遮挡剔除（Occlusion Culling）的作用："}]},{"ID":"20251104173303-xei89cy","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251104173303-xei89cy","updated":"20251104173304"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104173304-pxfh8wz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251104173304-pxfh8wz","updated":"20251104173304"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104173304-4z9ucl1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104173304-4z9ucl1","updated":"20251104173324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"让被遮挡，不可见的物体不再进入渲染管线"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104173325-h2nt7x2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251104173325-h2nt7x2","updated":"20251104173325"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104173325-ec1tdta","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104173325-ec1tdta","updated":"20251104173350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少 DrawCall，顶点处理，像素填充 等开销"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104173352-lj84t7p","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251104173352-lj84t7p","updated":"20251104173352"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104173352-ooxclj0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104173352-ooxclj0","updated":"20251104173429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"提升性能，尤其是在室内场景，城市场景，森林 这种遮挡很多的环境"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251104173430-c1di7j9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104173430-c1di7j9","updated":"20251104173542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如：玩家在一个房间里，外面的街道模型其实完全看不到，没有必要渲染他们\n如果没有遮挡剔除，这些在摄像机视锥范围内的对象依然会被送进 GPU 渲染，浪费性能"}]},{"ID":"20251104173542-brsqtff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104173542-brsqtff","updated":"20251104173655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"说人话：遮挡剔除弥补了视锥剔除的局限性，让 Unity 可以剔除那些在摄像机视锥内，但是被挡住的对象，这样可以节约 GPU 渲染性能"}]},{"ID":"20251105111923-ipe1xv6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251105111923-ipe1xv6","updated":"20251105111935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"遮挡剔除的具体内容可见："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkAHref":"https://docs.unity.cn/cn/2022.3/Manual/OcclusionCulling.html","TextMarkTextContent":"遮挡剔除 - Unity 手册"}]},{"ID":"20251104173655-18rcob3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251104173655-18rcob3","updated":"20251104175322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"遮挡剔除的作用"}]},{"ID":"20251104173715-ublynpr","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251104173715-ublynpr","updated":"20251104175318"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104173749-a217p9s","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251104173749-a217p9s","updated":"20251104173749"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104173749-bm2acfy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104173749-bm2acfy","updated":"20251104173804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"设置需要使用遮挡剔除的对象为遮挡静态对象"}]},{"ID":"20251104174008-mehb20f","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251104174008-mehb20f","updated":"20251104174010"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104174010-db4w9on","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251104174010-db4w9on","updated":"20251104174010"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104174010-5icj1uj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104174010-5icj1uj","updated":"20251104174102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"会遮挡别人的物体（比如建筑、墙体、山体等）——\u003e 设置为 Occluder Static（静态遮挡物）"}]},{"ID":"20251104175151-1gh95b6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104175151-1gh95b6","updated":"20251104175151"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251104175151-i05zjkn.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20251104174103-gd8bo1s","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251104174103-gd8bo1s","updated":"20251104174103"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251104174103-4xlmnxb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104174103-4xlmnxb","updated":"20251104174147"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可能被遮挡的物体（比如角色、家具、树木等）——\u003e 设置为 Occludee Static（静态被遮挡物）"}]},{"ID":"20251104175230-bkxo988","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104175230-bkxo988","updated":"20251104175231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251104175231-dkcyl1n.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251104174151-9jzoe0d","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20251104174151-9jzoe0d","style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);","updated":"20251104174158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003